# Files ignored when publishing to pub.dev.
#
# `.pubignore` replaces the root `.gitignore` for pub, so the usual
# ignores are repeated here. The published package contains `lib/`, the
# platform folders (`ios/`, `android/`), `doc/`, `test/`, the bare
# `example/` (lib, integration_test, pubspec.yaml, platform runners),
# README.md, CHANGELOG.md, LICENSE and NOTICE. Everything below stays out.

# Vendored research material (Meta's official samples + community plugin).
meta-glasses-research/

# Polished sample apps. They live in the repository; consumers can fetch
# them from GitHub.
samples/


# Repository tooling, CI and coverage output.
tool/
coverage/
.github/
install-skills.sh
context7.json

# AI assistant configuration.
.claude/
.cursor/

